*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.suo
*.rsuser

# ----- Build output -----------------------------------------
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

